<view class="page"><view class="title">我的甜蜜预订</view><view class="subtitle">每一份预订的进度，都在这里。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view wx:if="{{!orders.length && !busy}}" class="empty"><view class="title">还没有预订呢</view><view class="small">挑一份喜欢的蛋糕，为下一次庆祝做好准备。</view><button bindtap="shop">去挑选蛋糕</button></view><view wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id" class="panel" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row"><text class="small muted">{{item.number}}</text><text class="status">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view><view class="product-line"><view class="thumb"><cake-art theme="{{item.product.theme}}"/></view><view><view class="name">{{item.product.name}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.product.size}} / {{item.product.flavor}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.date}} {{item.time}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{item.request}}" class="info">取消或改期申请待店员审核</view><view class="row divider"><text class="small muted">总额 ¥{{item.totalYuan}} · 已付 ¥{{item.paidYuan}}</text><text class="small">查看订单 →</text></view></view></view>
